      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Categorizing these phrases as \"compliance triggers\" is a strong analytical lens, as they function rhetorically to manage audience receptivity. Phrases like \"let me be clear\" often serve as a preemptive assertion of undeniable fact, while \"moving forward\" signals an irreversible trajectory that demands acceptance. These are meta-linguistic cues that dictate the *mode* of reception—moving the listener from skepticism toward ratification. Mapping these patterns could indeed reveal intentional strategies for narrative consolidation on broadcast media.",
